description=Nobody remembers the batteries unless they are on the list. Write a grocery list, carry what is on it and it crosses itself off. Bring a friend's list back and you both feel better. <LINE> <LINE>
description=<H2> How it works <LINE> <TEXT>
description=- Craft a Grocery List from a sheet of paper, graph paper or a notepad. Right-click it and choose Write Note. You need a pen or pencil. <LINE>
description=- Write one item per line. Part of the name is enough: beans matches Canned Beans. <LINE>
description=- Carry the list. Lines that match something you carry, bags included, get [x]. <LINE>
description=- Finish a list of three or more items: 10 less boredom and 5 less unhappiness. <LINE>
description=- Hand a finished list back to the person who wrote it. They get it signed with your name, and you both get 10 less unhappiness. <LINE> <LINE>
description=<H2> Setup and limits <LINE> <TEXT>
description=No required mods. Install on the server and every client. Add SharedGroceryList to the server Mods list. Each reward pays each person once per 24 game hours. In multiplayer the server matches item names in its own language, usually English. Grocery List items need the mod. Network split-screen notifications target the first local player.
